### 회원 가입
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup/student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": "",
  "name": ""
}

### 이메일 인증코드 발송
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/email/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": ""
}

### 이메일 인증코드 값 인증
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/email/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "code": ""
}

### 로그인
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email" : "student1@momo.city",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 메시지 친구 목록(채팅 목록)
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/messages/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### v2 채팅방 목록
GET localhost:8080/api/v2/messages/chatrooms
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 채팅방 조회 및 개설
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/messages/chatrooms/create/12
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### v2 - 채팅방 조회 및 개설(일대일)
POST localhost:8080/api/v2/messages/chatrooms/create
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatMember": [2]
}

### v2 - 채팅방 조회 및 개설(다대다)
POST localhost:8080/api/v2/messages/chatrooms/create?roomTitle=다 나가고 전송 안됨 테스트방
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatMember": [3]
}

### 메시지 전송(v2 url 동일)
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/messages/send/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content" : "메시지 알림 테스트"
}

### 메시지 읽음 처리(v2 url 동일)
PATCH localhost:8080/api/v1/messages/read/16
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 메시지 내역 조회(20개씩)-최초 진입
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/messages/history/8
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### v2 - 메시지 내역 조회(20개씩)-최초 진입
GET localhost:8080/api/v2/messages/history/7
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 메시지 내역 조회(20개씩)-스크롤
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/messages/history/8?lastMessageId=10
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### v2 - 메시지 내역 조회(20개씩)-스크롤
GET localhost:8080/api/v2/messages/history/16?lastMessageId=67
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 채팅방 나가기(v2 url 동일)
DELETE localhost:8080/api/v1/messages/chatRooms/leave/7
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### v2 - 다대다 채팅 이름 수정
PATCH localhost:8080/api/v2/message/chatrooms/modify/7
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomTitle" : "다대다 방이름 변경 시도"
}

### v2 - 다대다 채팅 멤버 초대하기
POST localhost:8080/api/v2/message/chatrooms/invite/7
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatMember": []
}
